            "text": "Aquí tienes la consulta SQL para BigQuery que calcula la distribución estadística del número de diagnósticos clínicos distintos por paciente, incluyendo la media, desviación típica, cuartiles (Q1, Mediana, Q3) y los límites para identificar valores extremos (outliers) utilizando el método del rango intercuartílico (IQR), así como el recuento de pacientes considerados outliers.\n\n```sql\nWITH PatientDiagnosisCounts AS (\n    SELECT\n        person_id,\n        COUNT(DISTINCT condition_concept_id) AS distinct_diagnosis_count\n    FROM\n        `condition_occurrence`\n    GROUP BY\n        person_id\n),\nAggregatedStatistics AS (\n    SELECT\n        AVG(distinct_diagnosis_count) AS mean_diagnoses,\n        STDDEV(distinct_diagnosis_count) AS stddev_diagnoses,\n        MIN(distinct_diagnosis_count) AS min_diagnoses,\n        MAX(distinct_diagnosis_count) AS max_diagnoses,\n        APPROX_QUANTILES(distinct_diagnosis_count, 100)[OFFSET(25)] AS q1_diagnoses,\n        APPROX_QUANTILES(distinct_diagnosis_count, 100)[OFFSET(50)] AS median_diagnoses,\n        APPROX_QUANTILES(distinct_diagnosis_count, 100)[OFFSET(75)] AS q3_diagnoses,\n        COUNT(*) AS total_patients\n    FROM\n        PatientDiagnosisCounts\n),\nCalculatedOutlierBounds AS (\n    SELECT\n        mean_diagnoses,\n        stddev_diagnoses,\n        min_diagnoses,\n        max_diagnoses,\n        q1_diagnoses,\n        median_diagnoses,\n        q3_diagnoses,\n        (q3_diagnoses - q1_diagnoses) AS iqr_diagnoses,\n        (q1_diagnoses - 1.5 * (q3_diagnoses - q1_diagnoses)) AS lower_bound_outlier,\n        (q3_diagnoses + 1.5 * (q3_diagnoses - q1_diagnoses)) AS upper_bound_outlier\n    FROM\n        AggregatedStatistics\n)\nSELECT\n    CAST(cb.mean_diagnoses AS FLOAT64) AS mean_diagnoses,\n    CAST(cb.stddev_diagnoses AS FLOAT64) AS stddev_diagnoses,\n    CAST(cb.min_diagnoses AS BIGNUMERIC) AS min_diagnoses,\n    CAST(cb.max_diagnoses AS BIGNUMERIC) AS max_diagnoses,\n    CAST(cb.q1_diagnoses AS FLOAT64) AS q1_diagnoses,\n    CAST(cb.median_diagnoses AS FLOAT64) AS median_diagnoses,\n    CAST(cb.q3_diagnoses AS FLOAT64) AS q3_diagnoses,\n    CAST(cb.iqr_diagnoses AS FLOAT64) AS iqr_diagnoses,\n    CAST(cb.lower_bound_outlier AS FLOAT64) AS lower_bound_outlier,\n    CAST(cb.upper_bound_outlier AS FLOAT64) AS upper_bound_outlier,\n    (SELECT COUNT(1) FROM PatientDiagnosisCounts pdc\n     WHERE pdc.distinct_diagnosis_count < cb.lower_bound_outlier\n        OR pdc.distinct_diagnosis_count > cb.upper_bound_outlier\n    ) AS count_outliers\nFROM\n    CalculatedOutlierBounds cb;\n```"
          }
        ],
